# Markdown is deliberately NOT formatted.
#
# The docs here are hand-wrapped prose with aligned tables and terminal
# transcripts inside fenced blocks. Prettier normalizes list markers and
# realigns table pipes, which produces a large diff that changes no meaning —
# and `format:check` would then gate docs on cosmetics every time one is
# edited. Formatting prose is a separate decision from formatting code.
*.md
